    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、一生懸命頑張ってきたからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050020,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050030,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "あ……で、でも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050040,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "いえ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charAnim3": "face_sad",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050050,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "わたしのこと、こんなに評価してもらえるって……\r\nゆ、夢みたいで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……大丈夫、夢じゃないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "霧子が積み上げてきたものが、\r\nちゃんと伝わったってことなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050060,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "積み上げてきたもの……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、霧子が今まで周りのみんなに向けてきた思いやりだ\r\n……アイドルになる前からな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなそれに励まされるし、\r\nみんな、霧子のことを応援したくなる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部、霧子が頑張ってきたことへの\r\n自然な評価だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050070,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050080,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "あの……\r\nう、嬉しいです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？\r\n霧子はもっと、自分に自信を持っていいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050100,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "はい……\r\nわ、わたし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050110,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "わたし、ちゃんとわかりました……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050120,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "みなさんのためにっていうのが……\r\nどんなことなのかって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700800105/7008001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7008001050130,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "みなさんとわたしのために\r\nもっともっと……何ができるかって……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
